Date:   Sun Nov 15 23:08:58 2026 -0300

    Fix evaluator defects 1-6 and 8 in conversation history
    
    - Keep every failed question until retried or dismissed (no overwrite)
    - Confirm cited documents via documents.get to avoid ghost details
    - Move focus to the conversation heading after Clear; Escape cancels confirm
    - Allow Clear to recover from an unreadable history at startup
    - Add 'Jump to latest answer' skip control and Alt+ArrowUp shortcut
    - Show plain error wording with technical details in a disclosure
    - Split turn components into ConversationTurns.tsx
    
    Evidence: docs/evidence/conversation-history/generator/fixes/ (18/18 runtime checks)

